      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10141638556147712
    m_Localized: When {COR_J}J = 0{FIM} and {COR_K}K = 0{FIM}, remain in the same
      output position!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10141641429245952
    m_Localized: When {COR_J}J = 1{FIM} and {COR_K}K = 0{FIM}, remain at output position
      1 (high)!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10141643106967552
    m_Localized: When {COR_J}J = 0{FIM} and {COR_K}K = 1{FIM}, stay at output position
      0 (low)!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10141644545613824
    m_Localized: When {COR_J}J = 1{FIM} and {COR_K}K = 1{FIM}, switch output positions!
